sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant B as BFF
    participant H as API handler
    participant S as Storage

    U->>C: Action
    C->>B: Request
    B->>H: Validate and route
    H->>S: Read/write data
    S-->>H: Result
    H-->>C: Response
    C-->>U: Update UI
